@startuml 04-seq-consultar-extrato-aluno
' KarvCoins — Sequência US04: Consultar Extrato (Aluno)
' Visão caixa-branca: Aluno ↔ SPA ↔ JwtFilter ↔ AlunoController ↔ AlunoService ↔ ExtratoService ↔ Repositories ↔ DB

title Sequência de Realização — US04: Consultar Extrato (Aluno)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #B7791F
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F3F4F6
  BorderColor #9E9E9E
}

actor "Aluno" as AL
participant ":SPA Angular" as SPA
participant ":JwtFilter\n(Spring Security)" as JWT
participant ":AlunoController" as AlunoCtrl
participant ":AlunoService" as AlunoSvc
participant ":ExtratoService" as ExtratoSvc
participant ":AlunoRepository" as AlunoRepo
participant ":TransacaoRepository" as TrRepo
participant ":ResgateRepository" as ResRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Carregar saldo atual ==

AL -> SPA : acessar extrato
SPA -> JWT : GET /api/karv-coins/alunos/me/resumo\n(Authorization: Bearer token)
activate JWT
JWT -> JWT : validarToken() — extrairPrincipal()
JWT -> AlunoCtrl : getResumoMe(Principal)
activate AlunoCtrl
AlunoCtrl -> AlunoSvc : getResumoMe(alunoId)
activate AlunoSvc
AlunoSvc -> AlunoRepo : findById(alunoId)
activate AlunoRepo
AlunoRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM alunos a JOIN usuarios u ON a.id=u.id WHERE a.id=?
DB --> AlunoRepo : row
AlunoRepo --> AlunoSvc : Aluno
deactivate AlunoRepo
AlunoSvc --> AlunoCtrl : AlunoResumoDTO {nome, saldo}
deactivate AlunoSvc
AlunoCtrl --> JWT : 200 OK + AlunoResumoDTO
deactivate AlunoCtrl
JWT --> SPA : 200 OK + JSON
deactivate JWT
SPA --> AL : exibir saldo atual

== Carregar histórico de transações ==

SPA -> JWT : GET /api/karv-coins/alunos/me/extrato\n(Authorization: Bearer token)
activate JWT
JWT -> JWT : validarToken() — extrairPrincipal()
JWT -> AlunoCtrl : getExtratoMe(Principal)
activate AlunoCtrl
AlunoCtrl -> ExtratoSvc : getExtratoAluno(alunoId)
activate ExtratoSvc

ExtratoSvc -> TrRepo : findByAlunoId(alunoId)
activate TrRepo
TrRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM transacoes WHERE aluno_id=? ORDER BY data DESC
DB --> TrRepo : rows (recebimentos de moedas)
TrRepo --> ExtratoSvc : List<Transacao>
deactivate TrRepo

ExtratoSvc -> ResRepo : findByAlunoId(alunoId)
activate ResRepo
ResRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM resgates WHERE aluno_id=? ORDER BY data DESC
DB --> ResRepo : rows (resgates de vantagens)
ResRepo --> ExtratoSvc : List<Resgate>
deactivate ResRepo

note right of ExtratoSvc
  Consolida recebimentos e resgates
  em lista unificada de ExtratoItemDTO,
  ordenada por data decrescente.
end note

ExtratoSvc --> AlunoCtrl : List<ExtratoItemDTO> {data, tipo, valor, descricao}
deactivate ExtratoSvc
AlunoCtrl --> JWT : 200 OK + List
deactivate AlunoCtrl
JWT --> SPA : 200 OK + JSON
deactivate JWT
SPA --> AL : exibir histórico de transações

@enduml
